--[[
    Icon Resolver for Roblox Icons
    Maps pack-prefixed icon names (e.g. "lucideArrowDown") to raw GitHub URLs.

    Icon names are unique across all packs: <pack><IconName> in camelCase
    (case-sensitive), so the same base icon name never collides between packs.

    Usage:
        local Icons = require(path.to.icons)
        local url = Icons.get("lucideArrowDown")       -- global lookup
        local url = Icons.getByPack("material", "add") -- pack + original name

    Sizes: lucide 64x64, material 24x24, tabler/phosphor/heroicons/feather 48x48.
--]]

